<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ewart buys Scottish car park for 1.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Ewart buys Scottish car park for 1.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Irish-based property group Ewart Plc said on Wednesday that it had acquired a surface car park at Boswell Park in Ayr, Scotland, for a total of 1.1 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Prior to the acquisition, the car park was managed by Ewart Car Parks Ltd and its purchase will provide an additional contribution of 90,000 stg per annum as Ewart will no longer have to pay rental costs of this amount, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
